      "text": "你回来啦。"
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_003",
      "dialogue_id": "ACT1_03_FRIEND_FIRST",
      "text": "那什么……天冷了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_004",
      "dialogue_id": "ACT1_03_FRIEND_FIRST",
      "text": "晚上出门，多穿点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_005",
      "dialogue_id": "ACT1_03_FRIEND_FIRST",
      "text": "今年冬天来得早。"
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_006",
      "dialogue_id": "ACT1_03_FRIEND_PLANT",
      "text": "……你回来啦。"
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_007",
      "dialogue_id": "ACT1_03_FRIEND_PLANT",
      "text": "楼下那盆绿植，我隔几天来浇一次水。"
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_008",
      "dialogue_id": "ACT1_03_FRIEND_PLANT",
      "text": "你别多想。就是……顺手。"
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_009",
      "dialogue_id": "ACT1_06_NAME_REVEAL",
      "text": "听说你回来了。那个……你要是想聊聊，我随时都在。"
